<div class="page-hero">
  <div class="eyebrow">Reading the data</div>
  <h1>Methodology<br><span class="dim">&amp; Glossary</span></h1>
  <p class="standfirst">
    Almost every number published about this war is a claim by an interested party. This page sets out where each
    figure on the tracker comes from, what it counts, what it does not count, and the specific artefacts that will
    mislead you if you read the series without knowing about them. A glossary of unmanned systems terminology follows.
  </p>
</div>

